            {
              "atomType": "Readme",
              "x": 0.6,
              "y": 0.2,
              "uniqueID": "id-4763",
              "name": "README",
              "ioValues": [
                {
                  "name": "value",
                  "ioValue": "__GEOMETRY_INPUT__"
                }
              ],
              "readMeText": "## Dust hose adapter options\n\nThe machine above uses the 2.5 in adapter. These are the other sizes from the Maslow4 repository (1.25 in, 1.5 in, 2 in, 2.31 in, 4 in and 40 mm Festool), lined up side by side. Each has an Export atom so it can be downloaded as a STEP file and printed.",
              "global": true
            }
          ],
          "allConnectors": [
            {
              "ap2Name": "Shape 1",
              "ap1ID": "id-4367",
              "ap2ID": "id-4493"
            },
            {
              "ap2Name": "Shape2",
